<main class="open-day-shell">
  <a class="return-link" href="/journeys/reviewing-a-community-centre-open-day-before-launch/">Return to the Testing journey</a>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Riverside Community Centre</p>
      <h1>Open day for everyone</h1>
      <p>Meet local groups, explore the centre, and try free activities on Saturday 12 September.</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Open-day navigation">
      <a href="#activities">Activities</a>
      <a href="#schedule">Schedule</a>
      <a href="#venue">Venue</a>
      <a href="#travel">Travel</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section id="activities" aria-labelledby="activities-heading">
    <h2 id="activities-heading">Featured activities</h2>
    <p>Highlights change automatically so visitors can discover different parts of the day.</p>
    <div class="feature" aria-live="off" data-feature>
      <p class="feature-count" data-feature-count>Activity 1 of 3</p>
      <h3 data-feature-title>Community garden tour</h3>
      <p data-feature-description>Meet the volunteer gardeners and learn what grows beside the centre.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="schedule" aria-labelledby="schedule-heading">
    <h2 id="schedule-heading">Plan your visit</h2>
    <p>Filter the schedule by the kind of activity you want to join.</p>
    <div class="filters" aria-label="Schedule filters">
      <button class="filter selected" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-filter="all">All activities</button>
      <button class="filter" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="creative">Creative</button>
      <button class="filter" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="movement">Movement</button>
    </div>
    <div class="schedule-grid" data-schedule-grid>
      <article data-category="creative">
        <p class="time">10:30</p>
        <h3>Make a neighbourhood banner</h3>
        <p>Work with an artist to add your ideas to a shared fabric banner.</p>
        <div class="save-activity" data-save tabindex="-1">♡ Save activity</div>
        <p class="save-status" data-save-status aria-live="polite"></p>
      </article>
      <article data-category="movement">
        <p class="time">12:00</p>
        <h3>Gentle movement session</h3>
        <p>Try seated and standing movements with a community instructor.</p>
        <button type="button">View activity details</button>
      </article>
      <article data-category="creative">
        <p class="time">14:00</p>
        <h3>All-ages music workshop</h3>
        <p>Explore rhythm with instruments supplied by the centre.</p>
        <a class="primary-link" href="#booking">Check booking information</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="venue" aria-labelledby="venue-heading">
    <h2 id="venue-heading">Find your way around</h2>
    <p>The welcome desk is opposite the garden entrance. Quiet activities are on the east side of the building.</p>
    <div class="map-layout">
      <svg class="venue-map" role="img" aria-label="Map of the community centre showing activity, quiet, and welcome areas" viewBox="0 0 640 360">
        <rect class="map-room activity-room" x="20" y="20" width="285" height="145" />
        <rect class="map-room quiet-room" x="335" y="20" width="285" height="145" />
        <rect class="map-room welcome-room" x="20" y="195" width="600" height="145" />
        <text x="65" y="100">Activity hall</text>
        <text x="390" y="100">Quiet room</text>
        <text x="215" y="280">Welcome and café</text>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <p><strong>Map key</strong></p>
        <ul class="map-key">
          <li><span class="key activity-room"></span> Purple: activities</li>
          <li><span class="key quiet-room"></span> Green: quiet spaces</li>
          <li><span class="key welcome-room"></span> Orange: welcome and refreshments</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="map-controls" aria-label="Map controls">
          <button type="button" aria-label="Zoom map in">+</button>
          <button type="button" aria-label="Zoom map out">−</button>
          <button type="button" aria-label="Reset map">↺</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="travel" aria-labelledby="travel-heading">
    <h2 id="travel-heading">Travel information</h2>
    <p>Watch the short travel update or use the transcript below it.</p>
    <video id="open-day-travel-video" controls preload="metadata" poster="/media/open-day-travel-information-poster.svg" aria-label="Travel information for the community centre open day">
      <source src="/media/open-day-travel-information.webm" type="video/webm" />
      <track kind="captions" src="/media/open-day-travel-information.en.vtt" srclang="en" label="English" default />
    </video>
    <details class="transcript">
      <summary>Travel video transcript</summary>
      <p>Travel to Riverside Community Centre on tram 7.</p>
      <p>Leave the tram at Riverside Square and follow signs to the garden entrance.</p>
      <p>The garden entrance has step-free access and an automatic door.</p>
      <p>Ask at the welcome desk if you would like help finding an activity.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section id="booking" class="booking" aria-labelledby="booking-heading">
    <h2 id="booking-heading">Booking information</h2>
    <p>Most activities are drop-in. The music workshop has limited capacity and can be reserved by phone from Monday.</p>
    <a class="primary-link" href="#contact">Contact the community centre</a>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <h2 id="contact-heading">Questions before your visit?</h2>
    <p>Call the community team on 555 0147 or visit the welcome desk during opening hours.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="fixed-booking-bar">
    <span>Music workshop places are limited</span>
    <a href="#booking">Booking information</a>
  </div>

  <div class="orientation-message" aria-hidden="true">
    <p>Please rotate your phone to portrait to use the open-day website.</p>
  </div>
</main>

<script>
  const features = [
    ['Community garden tour', 'Meet the volunteer gardeners and learn what grows beside the centre.'],
    ['Open ceramics studio', 'See community-made work and shape a small piece of clay.'],
    ['Meet the repair volunteers', 'Bring questions about repairing clothes and household objects.'],
  ];
  let featureIndex = 0;
  const featureCount = document.querySelector('[data-feature-count]');
  const featureTitle = document.querySelector('[data-feature-title]');
  const featureDescription = document.querySelector('[data-feature-description]');
  window.setInterval(() => {
    featureIndex = (featureIndex + 1) % features.length;
    if (featureCount) featureCount.textContent = `Activity ${featureIndex + 1} of ${features.length}`;
    if (featureTitle) featureTitle.textContent = features[featureIndex][0];
    if (featureDescription) featureDescription.textContent = features[featureIndex][1];
  }, 4000);

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach((button) => {
    button.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const selected = button.getAttribute('data-filter');
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach((candidate) => {
        const active = candidate === button;
        candidate.classList.toggle('selected', active);
        candidate.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
      });
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-category]').forEach((card) => {
        if (card instanceof HTMLElement) card.hidden = selected !== 'all' && card.dataset.category !== selected;
      });
    });
  });

  const save = document.querySelector('[data-save]');
  const saveStatus = document.querySelector('[data-save-status]');
  save?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    save.classList.toggle('saved');
    const saved = save.classList.contains('saved');
    save.textContent = saved ? '♥ Activity saved' : '♡ Save activity';
    if (saveStatus) saveStatus.textContent = saved ? 'Added to your saved activities.' : 'Removed from your saved activities.';
  });

  const video = document.querySelector<HTMLVideoElement>('#open-day-travel-video');
  const normalizeDuration = () => {
    if (!video || Number.isFinite(video.duration)) return;
    const resetPosition = () => {
      if (!Number.isFinite(video.duration)) return;
      video.currentTime = 0;
      video.removeEventListener('durationchange', resetPosition);
      video.removeEventListener('timeupdate', resetPosition);
    };
    video.addEventListener('durationchange', resetPosition);
    video.addEventListener('timeupdate', resetPosition);
    video.currentTime = Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER;
  };
  if (video?.readyState && video.readyState >= 1) normalizeDuration();
  else video?.addEventListener('loadedmetadata', normalizeDuration, { once: true });
</script>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-padding-bottom: 6rem; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #fafafa; color: #424242; font-family: 'Atkinson Hyperlegible', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .open-day-shell { max-width: 68rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 7rem; }
  a { color: #033573; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
  .return-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .site-header { padding: 2rem; border: 3px solid #6540a4; background: #f5f0ff; }
  .site-header nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .eyebrow, .time, .feature-count { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-weight: 700; }
  h1, h2, h3 { color: #292929; line-height: 1.2; }
  h1 { margin-block: 0.25rem 1rem; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4.5rem); }
  h2 { margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 2rem; }
  h3 { margin-block: 0.25rem 0.75rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .feature { min-height: 11rem; padding: 1.5rem; border: 3px solid #6540a4; background: #fff; }
  .filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-block: 1.25rem; }
  button, .primary-link { display: inline-flex; min-height: 3rem; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0.6rem 1rem; border: 3px solid transparent; border-radius: 0.25rem; background: #033573; color: #fff; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  button:hover, .primary-link:hover { border-color: #033573; background: transparent; color: #033573; }
  .filter.selected { border-color: #b33567; background: #fff; color: #5a1230; box-shadow: inset 0 -0.35rem #b33567; }
  .schedule-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .schedule-grid article { padding: 1.25rem; border: 2px solid #bbc9f7; }
  .save-activity { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.5rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem; border: 2px solid #033573; color: #033573; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  .save-activity:hover, .save-activity.saved { background: #e7f0ff; }
  .save-status { min-height: 1.6em; margin-bottom: 0; font-weight: 700; }
  .map-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(14rem, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: start; }
  .venue-map { width: 100%; height: auto; border: 2px solid #4c4c4c; background: #fff; }
  .map-room { stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 8; }
  .activity-room { fill: #7952b3; }
  .quiet-room { fill: #39855b; }
  .welcome-room { fill: #d87924; }
  .venue-map text { fill: #fff; font: 700 26px Arial, sans-serif; }
  .map-key { padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .key { display: inline-block; width: 1.25rem; height: 1.25rem; margin-right: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #333; vertical-align: middle; }
  .map-controls { display: flex; gap: 2px; }
  .map-controls button { width: 22px; min-width: 22px; height: 22px; min-height: 22px; padding: 0; border-width: 1px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  video { display: block; width: min(100%, 48rem); background: #15074d; }
  .transcript { max-width: 48rem; margin-top: 1rem; padding: 0.75rem; border: 2px solid #bbc9f7; }
  .transcript summary { font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  .booking, .contact { padding-bottom: 1rem; }
  .fixed-booking-bar { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; min-height: 4.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #15074d; color: #fff; }
  .fixed-booking-bar a { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
  .orientation-message { display: none; }
  a:focus, button:focus, summary:focus { outline: 3px solid #000; outline-offset: 4px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fff; }

  :global(.dark body) { background: #010017; color: #bdbdbd; }
  :global(.dark) h1, :global(.dark) h2, :global(.dark) h3 { color: #dedede; }
  :global(.dark) a { color: #ade5f8; }
  :global(.dark) .site-header { border-color: #6540a4; background: #070038; }
  :global(.dark) .feature { border-color: #6540a4; background: #070038; }
  :global(.dark) .schedule-grid article, :global(.dark) .transcript { border-color: #18399a; }
  :global(.dark) button, :global(.dark) .primary-link { background: #ade5f8; color: #000; }
  :global(.dark) button:hover, :global(.dark) .primary-link:hover { border-color: #ade5f8; background: transparent; color: #ade5f8; }
  :global(.dark) .filter.selected { border-color: #ef82ae; background: #010017; color: #ffd3e5; box-shadow: inset 0 -0.35rem #ef82ae; }
  :global(.dark) .save-activity { border-color: #ade5f8; color: #ade5f8; }
  :global(.dark) .save-activity:hover, :global(.dark) .save-activity.saved { background: #100842; }
  :global(.dark) a:focus, :global(.dark) button:focus, :global(.dark) summary:focus { outline-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #010017; }

  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .filter.selected { border-color: ButtonBorder; background: ButtonFace; color: ButtonText; box-shadow: none; }
    .map-room, .key { fill: Canvas; background: Canvas; border-color: CanvasText; forced-color-adjust: auto; }
    .venue-map text { fill: CanvasText; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .open-day-shell { padding-inline: 1rem; }
    .site-header { padding: 1.25rem; }
    .schedule-grid, .map-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 22rem) {
    .open-day-shell { padding-bottom: 5rem; }
    .fixed-booking-bar { position: fixed; z-index: 5; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; min-height: 6.5rem; margin: 0; align-items: flex-start; box-shadow: 0 -3px 8px rgb(0 0 0 / 25%); }
    .contact { padding-bottom: 0; }
  }

  @media (orientation: landscape) and (max-height: 31rem) and (max-width: 58rem) {
    .open-day-shell > :not(.orientation-message) { display: none; }
    .orientation-message { display: grid; position: fixed; inset: 0; place-items: center; padding: 2rem; background: #fafafa; color: #292929; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
